Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.74,1:27:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(夏洛克...)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  亲爱的  是不是迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, dear? Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 无聊死了  -  你就这样搭地铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, that was tedious.  -   You went on the tube like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出租车都不肯载我\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the cabs would take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有新闻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌干达军事政变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military coup in Uganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一张你的照片  戴着那顶...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another photo of you with the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内阁重组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, Cabinet reshuffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没点重要的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing of importance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  我得来点  给我弄去\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I need some. Get me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不行  -  给我弄点来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  -   Get me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  我们说好了完全戒烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Cold turkey we agreed, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你打点了附近所有商店  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you've paid everyone off, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两英里内没人会给你半根烟丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one within a two-mile radius will sell you any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么蠢的主意是谁出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid idea. Whose idea was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  夏洛克  你最近表现很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sherlock, you're doing really well, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别前功尽弃  -  快告诉我放哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- don't give up now!  -   Tell me where they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:02:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮不了你  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help, sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你下周彩票中奖号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know next week's lottery numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道  可总得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的私藏呢  把我的私房烟弄哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My secret supply, what have you done with my secret supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香烟  你把它们藏哪了  藏哪了到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cigarettes, what have you done with them?  Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不让我收拾你的东西  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You never let me touch your things! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这要怎么收拾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chance would be a fine thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记得你不是我们管家  -  的确不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you weren't my housekeeper.  -   I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来杯茶怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a nice cuppa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你可以先把鱼叉放一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perhaps you could put away your harpoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茶不够劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need something stronger than tea. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得比茶高七成的威力才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven percent stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又去找查特吉先生了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been to see Mr Chatterjee again.  
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三明治店那个  你穿着新裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandwich shop. That's a new dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袖子上沾了面粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's flour on the sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会穿成这样做点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't dress like that for baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克  -  指甲里有金属屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock...  -   Thumbnail. Tiny traces of foil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又玩刮刮乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been at the scratch cards again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都清楚你玩那东西没好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know where that leads, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皇城之夜  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Kasbah Nights. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周一早上就擦这个有点太过了吧  你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty racy for a Monday morning, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我写了篇关于香水鉴定的博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote a blog on the identification of perfumes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我的网站上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should look it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 够了吧  -  别指望那个查特吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please!  -   Don't pin your hopes on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会带你一起坐船出海了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that cruise with Mr Chatterjee,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在唐卡斯特有老婆  \N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got a wife in Doncaster 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只是别人不知道   -  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that nobody knows about.  -   Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody except me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么  我真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about, I really don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在搞什么飞机 \N{\fnArial\fs30}What the bloody hell was all that about?  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上去  向她道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go after her and apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  我真嫉妒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I envy you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嫉妒我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You envy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的头脑  简单平和  基本不转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind, it's so placid, straight-forward, barely used.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我的就像个引擎  不受控制地转个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine's like an engine, racing out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像枚火箭  被卡在了发射台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rocket, tearing itself to pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把自己炸成碎片了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}trapped on the launch pad. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要新案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a case!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才刚解决了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just solved one, 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还是用鱼叉叉头死猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}by harpooning a dead pig, apparently!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都是早上的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the next one?  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网站上没消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on the website?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生  \N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Mr Sherlock Holmes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的铃兰不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find Bluebell anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  能帮帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please can you help?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铃兰是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bluebell?  
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是只兔子  约翰  还有下文\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rabbit, John! But there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铃兰失踪前  它开始发光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Bluebell disappeared, it turned luminous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小精灵  这是小柯丝蒂的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Like a fairy," According to little Kirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二天早上  铃兰就失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the next morning, Bluebell was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:05:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笼子锁着  没有强行闯入的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hutch still locked, no sign of a forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在说什么啊  这正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I saying, this is brilliant! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打给雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他有只兔子跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him there's an escaped rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开玩笑  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不玩这个就玩妙探寻凶（推理卡牌）\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this or Cluedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不要  再也不跟你玩那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We are never playing that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么  -  因为凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not?  -   Because it's not actually possible 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能是被害人  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the victim to have done it, Sherlock. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一可能的解法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the only possible solution.  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这不符合游戏规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是游戏规则错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, the rules are wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一声铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力度极大  还不到半秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum pressure, just under the half second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是委托人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Client!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达特摩尔是个充满神话和传奇的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dartmoor, it's always been a place of myth and legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在茫茫荒野中是否还隐藏着其他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but is there something else lurking out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某种真实存在的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达特摩尔一直以来也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause Dartmoor is also home to one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府顶级机密行动的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}the government's most secret of operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的生化武器研究中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chemical and biological weapons research centre,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敏感度据说甚至超过波顿唐园区\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is said to be even more sensitive than Porton Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自二战结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the end of the Second World War,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于巴斯克维尔实验的传闻不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}there have been persistent stories about the Baskerville experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用基因变异培养用于战场的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genetic mutations, animals grown for the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:06:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人相信在这些栅栏后\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many who believe that within this compound, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这片古老荒野的腹地中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the heart of this ancient wildness,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有着超乎想象的恐怖存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are horrors beyond imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但真正的问题是  \N{\fnArial\fs30}But the real question is, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还被控制在基地内部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are all of them still inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时我还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那片荒原上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天很黑  可我确定我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dark, but I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道是什么东西杀死了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面正要说到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  可那是电视采访  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, in a TV interview.  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更想听听原版\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to do my own editing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  抱歉  当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Sorry, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But quite quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道达特摩尔吗  福尔摩斯先生  -  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know Dartmoor, Mr Holmes?  -   No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个神奇的地方  与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an amazing place, it's like nowhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然荒凉  却很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's sort of bleak, but beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没兴趣  继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not interested. Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈过世后  我和爸爸常出去散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to go for walks, after my mum died, my dad and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天晚上  我们都会去那片荒原\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every evening, we'd go out onto the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  直接跳到你父亲被残忍杀害的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, good. Skipping to the night that your dad was violently killed, 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事发地在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以说是个地标  叫恶魔谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a sort of local landmark, called Dewer's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是魔鬼的古称\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an ancient name for the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚你们看见魔鬼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the devil that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它体型巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煤黑色皮毛  红色眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coal-black fur with red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它抓住了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撕扯他  把他撕成了碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tore at him, tore him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它的我记不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二天早上被人发现时  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me the next morning, 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在荒原上游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}just wandering on the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲的尸体至今没有找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's body was never found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红色眼睛  煤黑皮毛  体型巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red eyes, coal-black fur, enormous...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗  还是狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dog? Wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是基因实验产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a genetic experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在笑我吗  福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you laughing at me, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:22.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲总在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was always going on about the things 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴斯克维尔的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were doing at Baskerville.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们究竟造出了什么样的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the type of monsters they were breeding there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去别人总是嘲笑他\N{\fnArial\fs30}People used to laugh at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少电视台的人把我说的当回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least the TV people took me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜这节目带动了德文郡的旅游业  \N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume did wonders for Devon tourism.  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  无论你父亲发生了什么事  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, whatever did happen to your father, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那已经是20年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么现在才来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why come to us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定你是不是能帮我  福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure you can help me, mr Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然把这当笑谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you find it all so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为昨晚发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  昨晚发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, what happened last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How... How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不知道  我观察到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know, I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坐德文郡开出的第一班火车过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came up from Devon on the first available train this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了差劲的早餐  喝了清咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a disappointing breakfast and a cup of black coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过道对面的女孩喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl on the seat across the aisle fancied you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你起初很有兴趣  但随后又变了心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though initially keen, you've now changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你现在  正急不可待地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, however, extremely anxious 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抽今天的第一支烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have your first cigarette of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奈特先生  请坐下抽完这支烟  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Mr Knight, and do please smoke. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会十分高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么注意到这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How on Earth did you notice all that?  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不重要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not important...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿孔纸屑表明你检过票  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Punched out holes where your ticket's been checked.  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是时候  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我都快憋死了  -  你这是炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, please, I've been cooped-up for ages!  -   You're showing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是爱炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I am a show-off, 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这类人就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用火车上的餐巾擦过溅出的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train napkin you used to mop up the spilled coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那污渍表明你没有加牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strength of the stain shows that you didn't take milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面还有番茄酱渍  \N{\fnArial\fs30}There are traces of ketchup on it 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你的嘴角和袖口也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on your lips and your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英式早点  或者是火车上能提供的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooked breakfast, or the nearest thing those trains can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道早餐很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know it was disappointing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火车上还能有什么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any other type of breakfast on a train?  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女性笔迹很有特点  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Female handwriting's distinctive, 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纸巾上是她的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrote her phone number down on the napkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从书写的角度来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell from the angle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她写字时面对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wrote at that she was sat across from you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还隔着条走道\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the other side of the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜在她下车后不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later after she got off, I imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用纸巾擦了洒出来的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}you used the napkin to mop up your spilled coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不小心把号码弄糊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}accidentally smudging the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用另一支笔重描了后四位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been over the last four digits in another pen, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你打算留着号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you wanted to keep the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可刚才你又用它擦鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just now you used the napkin to blow your nose,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你对她已经没什么兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe you're not that into her after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你颤抖的手指上有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's the nicotine stains on your fingers, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼古丁熏染的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}your shaking fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我熟悉这种痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在火车上没机会抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chance to smoke when on the train, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打车来这里前也没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}no time to roll one before you got a cab here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在才刚过9点15  你很绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just after 9.15, you're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从埃克塞特到伦敦的第一班车5点46发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first train from Exeter to London leaves at 5.46am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你坐了第一班车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the first one possible, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明昨晚一定发生了很重要的事  没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so something important must have happened last night. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点不差  相当准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're completely, exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  我早听说过你思维敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell, I heard you were quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的工作  现在别说了先来一支\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job. Now shut up and smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  你父母都去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, your parents both died 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时你是七岁左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were what, seven years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一定是巨大的创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be quite a trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, have you ever thought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是你幻想了这个故事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe you invented this story, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来解释父母的离世\N{\fnArial\fs30}to account for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫蒂默医生也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Dr Mortimer says.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的心理医生  -  我的心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His therapist.  -   My therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露易丝·莫蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louise Mortimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她让我回到达特摩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the reason I came back to Dartmoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:29.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她觉得我必须面对心魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks I have to face my demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚回到恶魔谷后\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened when you went back 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Dewer's Hollow last night, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听了心理医生的话回到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went there on the advice of your therapist
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可现在却来求助于侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're consulting a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了什么让你改了主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see that changed everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那山谷很诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a strange place, the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人内心冰冷  异常恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes you feel so cold inside, so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我想读诗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, if I wanted poetry, 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以读约翰给女友的电邮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd read John's emails to his girlfriends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比这有趣得多  直说你看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}much funnier. What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:12:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我看见我父亲被撕碎的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the exact spot where I saw my father torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人的还是女人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man's or a woman's?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都不是  那是...  -  如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neither. They were...  -   Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没别的了  脚印  就这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else? Footprints, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  可那些脚印...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But they were...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  莫蒂默医生说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sorry, Dr Mortimer wins. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用自编的记忆掩盖儿时的心理创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a childhood trauma masked by an invented memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊  请吧  奈特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring. Goodbye, Mr Knight, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you for smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那些脚印呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the footprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是兽爪印\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably paw prints,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都可能  也就是什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be anything, therefore nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧  吃点奶油茶点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off to Devon with you and have a cream tea on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:25.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一头巨型猎犬的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were the footprints of a gigantic hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到一些脚印  非常大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found footprints, they were big...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  要你刚才的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, your exact words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:38.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原样重复你刚才那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat your exact words from a moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一字不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly as you said them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一头巨型猎犬的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were the footprints of a gigantic hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这案子我接了  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take the case. -  Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你提醒了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for bringing this to my attentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里大有文章  -  等下  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it's very promising. -  No no no, sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚说脚印无聊呢  现在又大有文章了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minute ago, footprints were boring, now they're very promising?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟脚印无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got nothing to do with footprints,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就没仔细听  巴斯克维尔  听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't listening. Baskerville, ever heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概吧  相当机密的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaguely. It's very hush-hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 从那儿查起准没错  -  你要去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like a good place to start. -  You'll come down then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  现在我不能离开伦敦  太忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't leave London at the moment, far too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  我最得力的助手会跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, I'm putting my best man onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让约翰把相关信息发给我肯定没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can always rely on John to send me the relevant data,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然他自己一点都不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he never understands a word of it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫你很忙  你手头根本没案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about you are busy? You don't have a case!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才还抱怨...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minute ago you were complaining... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  我有铃兰的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bluebell, John! I've got Bluebell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个无故消失的夜光兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case of the vanishing glow-in-the-dark rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 北约都乱成一团了  -  那你不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- NATO's in uproar. -  Sorry, you're not coming, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不着了  我要去达特摩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need those any more, I'm going to Dartmoor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先去吧  亨利  我们随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on ahead, Henry, we'll follow later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要去喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, so you are coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20年前的迷案  巨型猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}20-year-old disappearance, a monstrous hound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't miss this for the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么一起游船  你根本不想带我上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}..cruise together, you had no intention of taking me on a boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来赫德森太太终于找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Mrs Hudson finally got to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个在唐卡斯特的老婆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wife in Doncaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还没发现伊斯兰堡的那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait until she finds out about the one in Islamabad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦去帕丁顿车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paddington Station, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边是巴斯克维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Baskerville.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是格林盆镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Grimpen Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边肯定是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  恶魔谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dewer's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷区吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mine field?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,严格说巴斯克维尔是个军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, Baskerville's an army base,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜他们一直都不准外人入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I guess they've always been keen to keep people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  一天三次  告诉你们朋友  告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, three tours a day. Tell your friends, tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常欢迎各位  记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be strangers. And remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上千万别去荒原\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay away from the moor at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不想死的话  保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you value your lives! Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那部分记忆没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That part doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:17:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的  是一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something else. It's a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}In.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,IN\N{\fnArial\fs30}I. N.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由在  这什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty In. What do you think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉不能给你们双人房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry we couldn't do a double room for you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  我们不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine. We're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢啦  我找你钱  -  谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ta. I'll just get your change. -  Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help noticing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那片荒原的地图上  有个骷髅头\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the map of the moor, a skull and crossbones?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 海盗吗  -  不  叫格林盆大雷区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pirates? -  No. The Great Grimpen Minefield, they call it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样  那是巴斯克维尔试验场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think. It's the Baskerville testing site.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有80多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been going for 80-odd years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我估计没人知道里面到底有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure anyone really knows what's there any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 炸弹吗  -  不止是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Explosives? -  Not just explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说闯进那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break into that place and if you're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被炸死算走运的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just get blown up, so they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可别散步走到了那边  -  谢啦  我会记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In case you're planning a wee stroll. -  Ta. I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  对旅游业有所影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. No, that buggers up tourism a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢那条恶魔猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}so thank God for the demon hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看那节目了吗  那纪录片  -  前不久看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see that show? The documentary? -  Quite recently, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝保佑亨利·奈特和那怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless Henry Knight and his monster from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见过吗  那猎犬  -  我吗  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ever seen it? The hound? -  Me? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗莱彻见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fletcher has.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会带游人参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs the walks, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参观怪物出没的地方  他见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the monster walks for the tourists, you know. He's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这生意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's handy for trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利  我们真是要忙死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying we've been rushed off our feet, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  很多怪物猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, lots of monster hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费不了多大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't take much these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在推特上一发人就都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one mention on Twitter and whoomph!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of WKD.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  -  又是怪物又是监狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. -  What with the monster and the ruddy prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我们怎么睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we sleep nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢  盖瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 睡得可死了  -  说瞎话  他打呼噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like a baby.- That's not true. He's a snorer. Hey, ssh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你家那位打呼噜不  -  有薯片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is yours a snorer? -  Got any crisps?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行  保重  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No. All right? Right, take care. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介意我坐这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假的吧  你根本没见过什么猎犬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not true, is it, you haven't actually seen this hound thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是记者吗  -  不  绝对不是  就是好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you from the papers? -  No, nothing like that, just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你见过吗  -  大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you seen it? -  Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有证据吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要告诉你  失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I tell you if I did? Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我给亨利打了电话  -  打赌结束  约翰  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I called Henry. -  Bet's off John, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  -  打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? -  Bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的计划得等到天黑才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan needs darkness. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有一个半小时呢  -  等等  什么赌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could be got another half an hour of light. -  Wait, wait, what bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟约翰赌了50英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet John here 50 quid
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说你没法证明你见过猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you couldn't prove you'd seen the hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  酒吧里的人说你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the guys in the pub said you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你就等着输钱吧  老兄  -  是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you're going to lose your money, mate. -  Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在一个月前  在山谷里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only about a month ago. Up at the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时有雾  看不太清\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was foggy, mind, couldn't make much out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白了  没目击者是吧  -  对  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see. No witnesses, I suppose. -  No, but... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.95,0:20:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  看那\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样  这叫什么证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? It's not exactly proof, is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  约翰  我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, John, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们不喜欢去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't like going up there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们感觉很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives them a bad sort of feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是闹鬼了吗  这样就想说服我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it haunted? Is that supposed to convince me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了  才不是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, don't be stupid! Nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为那儿确实有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I reckon there is something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从巴斯克维尔逃出来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something from Baskerville, escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克隆生物  超级狗  -  也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A clone? A super-dog? -  Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道这些年他们排放的气体是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows what they've been spraying on us all these years, 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者水里放了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or putting in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死活都不会信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't trust them as far as I could spit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the best you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个曾在国防部工作的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a mate once who worked for the MOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个周末我们约好去钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}One weekend we were meant to go fishing, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没出现  很晚才过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he never showed up. Well, not till late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来的时候脸色惨白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he did, he was white as a sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到现在都记忆犹新\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我今天看见些东西  弗莱彻"  他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I've seen things today, Fletcher," He said,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我再也不想见第二次"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and I never want to see again."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"可怕的东西"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Terrible things."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被派去过某个秘密军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd been sent to some secret army place. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是波顿唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porton Down, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是巴斯克维尔  或者其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Baskerville, or somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边的秘密实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the labs there, the really secret labs,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他见过可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he'd seen terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说老鼠和狗一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rats as big as dogs, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗呢  和马一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dogs, dogs the size of horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,50块拿来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did say 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请出示通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.95,0:22:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有巴斯克维尔的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got ID for Baskerville?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这里的  是我哥哥的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not specific to this place. It's my brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都能进  那什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access all areas. I, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.71,0:22:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好久前拿到的  以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}acquired it a quiet ages ago. Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这下好了  -  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brilliant. -  What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们会被逮捕  -  才不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll get caught. -  No, we won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 目前不会  -  五分钟内就会被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, not yet. -  Caught in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你好  我们就来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hi, officially, we come and have a wander
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.93,0:23:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们顶级秘密武器基地"\N{\fnArial\fs30}around your top secret weapons base."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.49,0:23:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"真的  太好了  进来吧  水正好开了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Really? Great. Come in, kettle's boiled."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会被打死还难说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's if we don't get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了  非常感谢  -  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear. Thanks very much. -  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直向前  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight through, sir. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.52,0:23:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶着麦考夫的名字去哪都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft's name literally opens doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.69,0:23:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早说过  他基本就代表了英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you, he practically is the British Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我估计在他们发现不对劲之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon we've got about 20 minutes 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有20分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they realise something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Are we in trouble? 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请叫我长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we in trouble, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  长官  对不起  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Sorry, sir. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.67,0:23:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在等我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were expecting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:23:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的证件信息直接发到我那儿了  福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ID showed up straight away, Mr Holmes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是莱昂下士  保安人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal Lyons, security.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something wrong, sir? 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下士  我希望没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not, Corporal, I hope not. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里通常没有人来检查  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get inspected here. You see, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太反常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just does't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.01,0:24:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说过抽查吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard of a spot check?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·华生上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain John Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.30,0:24:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 诺森伯兰第五燧发枪手团   -  长官好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fifth Northumberland Fusiliers. -  Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里莫尔少校肯定不高兴  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Barrymore won't be pleased, sir. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定想见您二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll want to see you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只怕我们没时间见他  我们要参观一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we won't have time for that. We need the full tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away. Carry on. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.46,0:24:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是命令  下士  -  遵命  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's an order, Corporal. -  Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice touch. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.25,0:24:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几百年没拿军衔唬人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't pulled rank in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 觉得爽吗  -  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enjoy it? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下面有多少动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many animals do you keep down here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.39,0:25:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有逃走的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ever escape? 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.86,0:25:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要逃走得学会用电梯  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have to know how to use that lift, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.47,0:25:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会把它们养得那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not breeding them that clever. 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非有人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they have help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are? 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.32,0:25:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  弗兰克兰博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Dr Frankland,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带两位先生参观一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just showing these gentlemen around. 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.61,0:25:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新面孔  真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}New faces, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.94,0:25:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过小心别困在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful you don't get stuck here,though,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.39,0:25:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当初只是来修水龙头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only came to fix a tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那电梯能下几层\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far down does that lift go? 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多层  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.92,0:25:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.91,0:25:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总得有地方放垃圾  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have to keep the bins somewhere, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.82,0:25:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way please, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.61,0:26:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里都做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what exactly is it that you do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.18,0:26:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为您知道  长官  这不是检查吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd know, sir, this being an inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.26,0:26:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我不是专家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not an expert, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.44,0:26:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从干细胞研究到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything from stem cell research to 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,治愈普通感冒  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to cure the common cold, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但多是武器研制吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly weaponry? 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各种武器  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of one sort or another, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生物武器  化学武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biological, chemical? 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争是一场接着一场  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}One war ends, another begins, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.19,0:26:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有新的敌人  我们要有所准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}New enemies to fight. We have to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.77,0:26:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  迈克  下次试试H3\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Michael, let's try Harlow 3 next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯坦佩顿博士  -  斯坦佩顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr Stapleton... -  Stapleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.69,0:26:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.04,0:26:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最高优先权  女士  上边的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority ultra, ma'am, orders from on high.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.61,0:26:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们来检查  -  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An inspection. -  Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯坦佩顿博士  请给予我们应得的尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to be accorded every courtesy, Dr Stapleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在巴斯克维尔是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your role at Baskerville?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚说了要以礼相待吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accorded every courtesy, isn't that the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能说  政府机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not free to say. Official secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.96,0:26:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你绝对能说  我强烈建议你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You most certainly are free, and I suggest you remain that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责多个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a lot of fingers in a lot of pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.40,0:27:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢搞混合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to mix things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.53,0:27:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数时候是混合基因  有时也会摆弄真手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genes, mostly. Now and again, actual fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯坦佩顿  我就知道我听过你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stapleton! I knew I knew your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.81,0:27:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们说这世上绝无巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say there's no such thing as coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.29,0:27:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的生活一定很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dull lives they must lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我女儿聊过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been talking to my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要弄死铃兰  斯坦佩顿博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Bluebell have to die, Dr Stapleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.54,0:27:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那只兔子  -  失踪了  而笼子锁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The rabbit? -  Disappeared from inside a locked hutch, 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很能说明问题  -  那只兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- which was always suggestive. -  The rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.07,0:27:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 显然是被人监守自盗  -  你这么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clearly an inside job. -  You reckon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  因为它会在黑暗中发光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because it glowed in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.72,0:27:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have absolutely no idea what you're talking about. 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.12,0:27:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们就看到这儿了  下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we've seen enough for now, corporal. 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢  -  这就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you so much. -  That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就完了  是走这边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. It's this way, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.49,0:27:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们潜入军事基地就为了调查小兔失踪案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we just break into a military base to investigate a rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用了23分钟  麦考夫动作变慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! 23 minutes. Mycroft's getting slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.93,0:28:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 少校  -  真他妈太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Major... -  This is bloody outrageous! 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没人通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wasn't I told?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.45,0:28:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巴里莫尔少校吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Barrymore, is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.33,0:28:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错  我们很受震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, we're very impressed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.11,0:28:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是  福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深受震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deeply. Hugely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.78,0:28:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立巴斯克维尔就是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole point of Baskerville was to 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.43,0:28:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 消除官僚的干扰  -  很抱歉  少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}- eliminate bureaucratic nonsense! -  So sorry, Major. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.81,0:28:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 检什么察  -  新政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inspections! - New policy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.19,0:28:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总不能永远不受监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't remain unmonitored for ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.13,0:28:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天晓得你们会做出什么事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}goodness knows what you'd get up to. 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.32,0:28:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别停步  -  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep walking. - Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.09,0:29:02.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们没有权限  长官  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ID unauthorised, sir. -  What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.68,0:29:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚接到一通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just had the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.77,0:29:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.97,0:29:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  显然是哪里搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's obviously been some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.45,0:29:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然没有  麦考夫·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly not, Mycroft Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.89,0:29:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是计算机出错了  少校  这都要写进报告里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer error, Major. It'll all have to go in the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.41,0:29:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  少校  我很清楚这两个人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Major, I know exactly who these gentlemen are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.21,0:29:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗  -  是啊  我现在认人有点慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do? -  Yeah, I'm getting a little slow on faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.41,0:29:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这位福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Mr Holmes here 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.80,0:29:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是没想到会在这儿见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't someone I expected to show up in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这个嘛...  -  很高兴又见面了  麦考夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well... - Good to see you again, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.65,0:29:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有幸在世界卫生组织大会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the honour of meeting Mr Holmes 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见过福尔摩斯先生  是在布鲁塞尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the WHO conference in... Brussels, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是维也纳  -  维也纳  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vienna. -  Vienna, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位正是麦考夫·福尔摩斯  少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mr Mycroft Holmes, Major. 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.57,0:29:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然是哪里搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's obviously been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.73,0:29:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了事唯你是问  弗兰克兰博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your head be it, Dr Frankland.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.71,0:29:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我送他们出去  下士  -  好的  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll show them out, Corporal. -  Very well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是为亨利·奈特来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about Henry Knight, isn't it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他想找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he wanted help, but 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.41,0:30:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可没想到他会去找夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realise he was going to contact Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.35,0:30:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  我知道你们的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直看你的网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never off your website.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我以为你会戴那顶帽子呢  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be wearing the hat, though. 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是我的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没戴帽子我差点没认出来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly recognise him without the hat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了不是我的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.13,0:30:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的博客我也很喜欢  华生医生  -  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love the blog, too, Dr Watson. - Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粉色的那起案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pink thing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有铝拐杖那起  -  可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that one about the aluminium crutch. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.06,0:30:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认识亨利·奈特  -  我跟他父亲更熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know Henry Knight? -  Well, I knew his dad better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对这里有各种疯狂的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had all sorts of mad theories about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.38,0:30:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他很够朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, he was a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.47,0:30:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我现在真的不方便说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I can't really talk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my cell number.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.86,0:30:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能帮上亨利  给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can help with Henry, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.95,0:30:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没问  弗兰克兰医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never did ask, Dr Frankland,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.43,0:30:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这儿到底是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what exactly is it that you do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.97,0:30:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生  我很想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, I would love to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.25,0:30:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  当然啦  那样我就得杀你灭口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then, of course, I'd have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你这大话说得可有点太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be tremendously ambitious of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说斯坦佩顿博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Dr Stapleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.71,0:31:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从不说同事的坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never speak ill of a colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.66,0:31:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你也不想说他们好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd speak well of one, which you're clearly omitting to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.41,0:31:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实如此  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do seem to be, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回头联系你  -  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be in touch. - Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说说吧  -  说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.33,0:31:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兔子的事是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was all that about the rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  我们这次别来这套  行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, can we not do this, this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.21,0:31:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪套  -  你一副神秘莫测的样子  板着脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what? -  You being all mysterious with your... cheekbones,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.21,0:31:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还竖起大衣领子扮酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turning your coat collar up so you look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.48,0:31:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我哪有  -  你就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't do that. - Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.17,0:31:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说  柯丝蒂的那封电邮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the email from Kirsty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失踪的夜光兔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missing luminous rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.29,0:31:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯丝蒂·斯坦佩顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirsty Stapleton,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她妈妈专门搞基因操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose mother specialises in genetic manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:32:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她把自己女儿的兔子变成夜光的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made her daughter's rabbit glow in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.09,0:32:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概加入了荧光基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a fluorescent gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.45,0:32:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从别处取出再植入样本体内  现在这不难办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Removed and spliced into the specimen. Simple enough, these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们就知道斯坦佩顿博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we know that Dr Stapleton
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.62,0:32:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在拿动物进行秘密基因实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}performs secret genetic experiments on animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.24,0:32:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有没有拿比兔子更致命的东西做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}has she been working on something deadlier than a rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.55,0:32:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公平地说  这个范围可有点广\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be fair, that is quite a wide field.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.47,0:32:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.83,0:32:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这房子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...很有钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, um, rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.51,0:32:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  -  了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.45,0:33:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couple of words, 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.29,0:33:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是看见这几个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's what I keep seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.17,0:33:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty? 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由  还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.80,0:33:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}In.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.84,0:33:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mean anything to you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.89,0:33:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由即死亡  是这么说的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty in death, isn't that the expression? 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.08,0:33:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡才是真正的解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only true freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.73,0:33:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.66,0:33:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克...有个计划吧  -  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock's... got a plan? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.02,0:33:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  -  我们带你回荒原去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. -  We take you back out onto the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.07,0:33:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  -  看看有没有东西来袭击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK... - And see if anything attacks you.  
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.00,0:33:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.61,0:33:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这应该能给我点线索  -  晚上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That should bring things to a head. -  At night?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.67,0:33:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要我晚上去那儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to go out there at night? 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.18,0:33:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划吗  真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan? Brilliant! 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.99,0:34:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还有更好的办法吗  -  这不叫计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got any better ideas? -  That's not a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.48,0:34:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  如果那里真有怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is a monster out there, John, 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.93,0:34:05.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能做一件事  找到它的窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only one thing to do. Find out where it lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.98,0:35:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UMQRA\N{\fnArial\fs30}UMQRA...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.50,0:35:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安克拉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}UMQRA...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.99,0:35:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock... 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.44,0:36:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.65,0:36:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我遇见了你的一位朋友  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Met a friend of yours? -  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克兰博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Frankland?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.82,0:36:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃啊  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Bob, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems pretty concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是爱操心  保佑他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a worrier, bless him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来后他一直对我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been very kind to me since I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.29,0:36:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他认识你父亲吗  -  对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knew your father? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.64,0:36:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他在巴斯克维尔工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he works at Baskerville.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.65,0:36:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲不是对那里有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't your dad have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.32,0:36:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可朋友到底是朋友  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, mates are mates, aren't they? 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.37,0:36:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你和约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you and John.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.67,0:36:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.62,0:36:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  他是个挺坦率的人  而你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, he's a pretty straightforward bloke and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.15,0:36:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍勃叔叔和我爸爸说好不谈工作的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they agreed never to talk about work, Uncle Bob and my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.55,0:36:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是恶魔谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewer's Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.77,0:36:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock....
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  我的天  我的老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, my god, my god! My god! My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.54,0:38:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.24,0:38:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听见了吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.82,0:38:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看见它了  我们看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw it. We saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.13,0:38:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我什么都没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.29,0:38:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  你说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.47,0:39:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.65,0:39:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he must have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.35,0:39:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见了  他肯定也看见了  肯定看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it. He must have. He must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...为什么  他为什么要那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... Why? Why? Why would he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它确实在那儿  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was there, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  你得坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, Henry, I need you to sit down. 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请你放松下来  -  我没事  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try and relax, please. -  I'm OK, I feel OK. 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你点帮你入睡的东西  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to give you something to help you sleep. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.69,0:39:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是好事  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good news, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... it's... it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.43,0:39:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里确实有猎犬  确实有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a hound there, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.18,0:39:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  他也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sherlock, he saw it too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.24,0:39:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他嘴上怎么说  他看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what he says, he saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他状态很不好  很狂躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's in a pretty bad way. He's manic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.11,0:40:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全坚信有条...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally convinced there's some...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.69,0:40:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级变种狗在荒原游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}mutant super-dog roaming the moors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.72,0:40:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过没有这回事  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there isn't, though, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.70,0:40:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果人们在制造超级变种狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos if people knew how to make a mutant super-dog, 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们肯定会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.91,0:40:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定会有的买  世道就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be for sale. I mean, that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  在荒原的时候我看见有人打信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, on the moor I saw someone signalling, 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.51,0:40:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩尔斯码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.57,0:40:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜是摩尔斯码  不过似乎说不太通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's Morse. It doesn't seem to make much sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.09,0:40:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,U  M  Q  R  A  有什么含义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}U, M, Q, R, A, does that mean anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧  我们都掌握了什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, OK, what have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.61,0:40:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道有脚印  因为亨利发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know there's footprints, because Henry found them,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.07,0:40:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个导游也发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so did the tour guide bloke.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.95,0:40:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听到了什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.52,0:40:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们该去找养了条大狗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just look for whoever's got a big dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.59,0:40:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亨利说得没错  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry's right. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.27,0:40:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.54,0:40:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  -  我也看到了  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? -  I saw it too, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... just a minute, you saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.78,0:41:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬  就在山谷那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hound. Out there in the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.67,0:41:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一条巨大的猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gigantic hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.11,0:41:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  夏洛克  我们得保持理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sherlock, we have to be rational about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.61,0:41:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, now you, 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.48,0:41:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最不该...\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all people, can't just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.38,0:41:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们关注目前了解的情况  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stick to what we know, yes? 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.47,0:41:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只讲事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.04,0:41:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦你排除了所有的不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've ruled out the impossible, 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的不管多么难以置信  一定就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever remains, however improbable, must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.13,0:41:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.94,0:41:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我  我害怕了  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, I'm afraid, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.06,0:41:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.15,0:41:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.49,0:41:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都冷眼旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been able to keep myself distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.79,0:41:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不动感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divorce myself from feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你瞧  我的身体背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look, you see, body's betraying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.40,0:41:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思  是啊  动感情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting, yes, emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.44,0:42:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白璧微瑕  美中不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grit on the lens, the fly in the ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.45,0:42:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right, 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.78,0:42:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯波克(星际迷航里的人物)  放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock, just... take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.78,0:42:06.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.80,0:42:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近一直都很兴奋  这你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been pretty wired lately, you know you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.09,0:42:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你刚刚走的这趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've just gone out there 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.96,0:42:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把自己搞得有点激动了  -  激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and got yourself a bit worked up. -  Worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.61,0:42:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚又黑又吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dark and scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.12,0:42:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗  我什么事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? There's nothing wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.02,0:42:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.84,0:42:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛...  -  我什么事都没有  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherl... -  There is nothing wrong with me! Do you understand!?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.10,0:42:43.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我证明给你看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to prove it, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.04,0:42:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要找的是条狗  巨大的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a dog, yes? A great big dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.19,0:42:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的天才论断  [法语]是在找狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's your brilliant theory. Cherchez le chien!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good! Excellent! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.73,0:42:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们从哪开始  从他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where shall we start? How about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.87,0:42:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤心的寡妇  和她失业的渔夫儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sentimental widow and her son, the unemployed fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.32,0:42:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 答案是她有狗  -  有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The answer's yes. -  Yes? 
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.54,0:42:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她养了条西部高原小猎犬  名叫威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a West Highland Terrier called Whisky,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.82,0:42:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是我们要找的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}not exactly what we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.19,0:43:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拜托  -  看他的毛衣  几乎全新\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For God's sake! -  Look at his jumper, hardly worn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.23,0:43:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然穿着很不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly he's uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.38,0:43:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因为材质或图案太丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be the material or the hideous pattern,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.29,0:43:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛衣应该是别人送的  多半是圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggests it's a present, probably Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.03,0:43:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想讨母亲欢心  为什么  多半是为钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants into his mother's good books. Why? Probably money.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.77,0:43:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他请母亲来吃饭  自己那份点的却很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's treating her to a meal, but his own portion is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.15,0:43:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想感动她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to impress her, 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却在自己那份上省钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's trying to economise on his own food.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.99,0:43:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他不饿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.37,0:43:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  小盘前菜  他连盆子都快舔干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, small plate, starter. He's practically licked it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.58,0:43:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而她连蛋白水果甜饼都没吃完\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's nearly finished her pavlova.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.04,0:43:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若是她请客  他完全可以放开了吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she'd treated him, he'd have had as much as he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.37,0:43:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他手头没钱  饥寒交迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hungry and not well-off,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.62,0:43:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以看他的袖口和鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can tell by his cuffs and shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.37,0:43:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道那是他母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know she's his mother, 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.49,0:43:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谁会送那种圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}who else would give him a Christmas present like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.90,0:43:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然也可能是姑姑或姐姐  但母亲最有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be an aunt or older sister, but mother's more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.13,0:43:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾是渔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he was a fisherman, 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.16,0:43:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手上的疤痕很独特  是鱼钩造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}the scarring on his hands is distinctive, fish hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.75,0:43:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤疤是很久前的了  说明失业已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're old, suggest he's been unemployment for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.63,0:43:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里工业并不发达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much industry in this part of the world, 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.83,0:43:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他才找自己的寡母求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he's turned to his widowed mother for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.55,0:43:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是寡母吗  当然  明摆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Widowed? Yes, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.78,0:43:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她项链里挂了个男戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a man's wedding ring on a chain around her neck, 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.69,0:43:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明显是她亡夫的  她自己戴太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}clearly her late husband's and too big for her finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.96,0:43:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她衣着精致  但首饰都是便宜货\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's well-dressed, but her jewellery is cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.37,0:43:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可以戴更好的  但由于情感原因一直没换\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could afford better, but she's kept it, sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.91,0:43:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道她养狗  她腿上有小细毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog? Tiny little hairs all over the leg
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.53,0:43:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但都不超过膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but none above the knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.39,0:43:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明是条小狗  估计是小猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggesting it's a small dog, probably a terrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.27,0:43:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是条名叫威士忌的西部高原小猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact it is a West Highland Terrier called Whisky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.95,0:43:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  你怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How the hell do you know that, Sherlock?"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.26,0:44:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跟我们同一辆火车过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause she was on the same train as us 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.32,0:44:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到她喊来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I heard her call its name. 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是作弊  而是善于倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not cheating, that's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.81,0:44:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会利用自己的感官  不像某些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use my senses, unlike some people, 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.86,0:44:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you see, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.66,0:44:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是好得不能再好  所以别烦我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I've never been better, so just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.05,0:44:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.91,0:44:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.10,0:44:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要听我的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.75,0:44:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我只是你朋友  -  我没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just your friend. -  I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.66,0:44:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.66,0:44:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪不得没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.13,0:45:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔登先生  你又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Selden, you've done it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.67,0:45:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老是刮上皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep catching it with my belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.17,0:45:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.34,0:46:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.34,0:46:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太讨厌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.88,0:48:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太刻薄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.22,0:48:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来点酒吗  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}More wine, doctor?  
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是要灌醉我吗  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to get me drunk, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.31,0:48:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought never occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.40,0:48:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我刚刚还以为你在泡我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a while ago I thought you were chatting me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.69,0:48:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我是怎么露馅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.97,0:48:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打听我的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you started asking about my patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.84,0:48:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是亨利的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am one of Henry's oldest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.68,0:48:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他是我的病人  我不能说他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and he's one of my patients, so I can't talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.41,0:48:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他跟我提过他的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although he has told me about all his oldest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.46,0:48:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是哪位  -  新的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one are you? -  A new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.13,0:48:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他父亲呢  他不是你病人了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, what about his father? He wasn't one of your patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.92,0:48:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是个阴谋论疯子...专家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't he some sort of conspiracy nutter... theorist?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.48,0:48:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有你错了才是疯了  -  那他错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're only a nutter if you're wrong. -  And was he wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.24,0:48:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 应该是吧  -  他执迷于巴斯克维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should think so. -  But he got fixated on Baskerville, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.10,0:48:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道里面到底在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what they were doing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.39,0:48:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有可能亨利也一样  幻想出一条猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't Henry have gone the same way, started imagining a hound?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.97,0:48:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你觉得我会谈这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I'll talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.62,0:48:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你很担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think you're worried about him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.41,0:48:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我也是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and because I'm a doctor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.09,0:48:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我另外一位朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because I have another friend
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.37,0:48:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能也有了同样的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}who might be having the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.19,0:49:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Watson! 
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.73,0:49:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 调查进展如何了  -  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the investigation going? -  Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.24,0:49:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  什么调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.56,0:49:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道吗  你没看过那个博客吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you know? Don't you read the blog? 
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.81,0:49:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克·福尔摩斯  -  是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock Holmes. -  It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.90,0:49:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock who?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.88,0:49:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私家侦探  这位是他的私人助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private detective. This is his PA.  
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.31,0:49:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私人助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}PA?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.15,0:49:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 同居在一起的私人助理  -  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, live-in PA. -  Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.03,0:49:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live-in..?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.74,0:49:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是莫蒂默医生  亨利的心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr Mortimer, Henry's therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.92,0:49:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我是鲍勃·弗兰克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Bob Frankland.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.08,0:49:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉夏洛克  我会盯着斯坦佩顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, tell Sherlock I've been keeping an eye on Stapleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.17,0:49:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想找我聊随时都可以  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time he wants a little chat. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.53,0:49:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请他喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you buy him a drink? 
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.48,0:49:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.87,0:50:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早  睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning! How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.49,0:50:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.07,0:50:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 睡得不好  -  真可惜 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't sleep very well. -  That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来泡点咖啡吧  看  你房子渗水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I make us some coffee? Look, you've got damp!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.52,0:50:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  昨晚...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.41,0:50:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么说自己什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you say you hadn't seen anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.41,0:50:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 虽然那条猎犬转眼就没了  但  -  是猎犬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, I only saw the hound for a minute, but... -  Hound?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.13,0:50:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  -  你为什么要说它是猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? -  Why do you call it a hound? Why a hound?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.18,0:50:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思  -  很奇怪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? What do you mean? -  It's odd, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:50:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有意思  你选了个老词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a strange choice of words, archaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.60,0:51:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我接案子就因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I took the case. 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.54,0:51:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生  那是一头巨型猎犬的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mr Holmes, they were the footprints of a gigantic hound."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.14,0:51:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要说"猎犬"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why say "Hound"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.29,0:51:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  我从没...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I've never...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.15,0:51:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咖啡还是不喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'd better skip the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.15,0:51:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那摩斯电码有头绪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get anywhere with that Morse code?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.11,0:51:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,U M Q R A  是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}U, M, Q, R, A, wasn't it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.28,0:51:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安克拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umqra.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.46,0:51:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.79,0:51:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧  我以为自己发现了什么  其实不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, forget it. I thought I was onto something, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.92,0:51:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确定吗  -  确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.02,0:51:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露易丝·莫蒂默那边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Louise Mortimer, 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.07,0:51:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有什么进展吗  -  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- did you get anywhere with her? -  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.58,0:51:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜啊  那你打听到什么消息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad. But did you get any information?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.66,0:52:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还开起玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being funny now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得能打破僵局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it might break the ice, a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.29,0:52:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说笑不适合你  还是冷一点好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny doesn't suit you. Let's stick to ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.91,0:52:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  -  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John... -  It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.08,0:52:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  昨晚的事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what happened last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.36,0:52:13.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我有了前所未有的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}something happened to me something I've not really experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.68,0:52:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说了  你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you said. Fear, 
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.98,0:52:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes got scared, you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.53,0:52:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅如此  约翰  我开始怀疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was more than that, John. It was doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.55,0:52:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感到怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.69,0:52:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直能相信自己的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been able to trust my senses, 
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.33,0:52:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信眼见为实的证据  直到昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}the evidence of my own eyes, until last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.97,0:52:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会真以为自己看到了什么怪物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't actually believe that you saw some kind of monster? 
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.13,0:52:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.72,0:52:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我确实看到了  那么问题是  怎么会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did see it, so the question is, how? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.74,0:52:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.95,0:52:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.01,0:52:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说你有头绪了  祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've got something to go on, then. Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.14,0:52:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  我之前说的话  是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, what I said before, John, I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.73,0:52:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.64,0:52:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身边就只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.63,0:52:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.77,0:53:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.65,0:53:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.27,0:53:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你简直太神奇太了不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are amazing! You are fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.08,0:53:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  你不用这么夸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all right, you don't have to overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.27,0:53:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你或许不是发光的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not be the most luminous of people, 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.66,0:53:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你是传递光的人  无与伦比\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as a conductor of light, you are unbeatable. 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.19,0:53:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.45,0:53:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人不是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people who aren't geniuses 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.47,0:53:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却有着激发天才的非凡能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}have an amazing ability to stimulate it in others. 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.33,0:53:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你刚才还道歉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. You were saying sorry a minute ago. 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.86,0:53:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这就扫兴好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.22,0:53:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧  我做什么了激发你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, what have I done that's so bloody stimulating?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.64,0:53:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.23,0:53:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这不是一个词  而是单独的字母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's not a word, what if it is individual letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.59,0:53:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这个是首字母缩写词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's an acronym?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.25,0:53:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没头绪  不过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely no idea, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.92,0:53:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?! 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.57,0:53:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you too
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.24,0:53:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在度假  你信吗  -  我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on holiday, would you believe? -  No, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.31,0:53:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  约翰  -  格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, John. -  Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.78,0:53:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你们在这边  忙什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were in the area. What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.53,0:53:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追查电视里说的那条地狱犬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you after this Hound of Hell, like on the telly?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.50,0:53:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没解释呢  探长  你为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting for an explanation, Inspector, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.27,0:53:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了  我在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you, I'm on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.41,0:53:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你晒得这么黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're brown as a nut. 
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.26,0:53:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明显是刚度假回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're clearly just back from your holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.72,0:53:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想再度一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fancied another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.09,0:53:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是麦考夫搞的鬼吧  当然是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mycroft, isn't it? Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.91,0:54:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到巴斯克维尔出了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One mention of Baskerville
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.05,0:54:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就派我的监护人来暗中监视我  还用化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he sends down my handler to spy on me, incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.11,0:54:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才自称什么"格雷格"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're calling yourself "Greg"?  
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.56,0:54:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他本来就叫那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.38,0:54:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗  -  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it? -  Yes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.84,0:54:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你压根就没关心过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd ever bothered to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.46,0:54:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好  我不是你的监护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not your handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.64,0:54:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是完全听命于你哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't just do what your brother tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.66,0:54:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 事实上  你来得正好  -  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, you could be just the man we want. -  Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.17,0:54:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没闲着  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've not been idle, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.73,0:54:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能找到了点线索  这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have found something. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.08,0:54:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前不知道是不是有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if it was relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.63,0:54:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过现在看上去似乎有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to look like it might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.20,0:54:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,素食餐厅  可用不了这么多肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an awful lot of meat for a vegetarian restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.13,0:54:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.63,0:54:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正好用得上一位苏格兰场探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice, scary inspector from Scotland Yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.50,0:54:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既亲切又恐怖  打几通电话就能让他们歇业\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can put in a few calls, might come in very handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.24,0:54:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.06,0:54:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.58,0:54:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咖啡  我泡了咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee. I made coffee. 
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.28,0:54:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你从不泡咖啡  -  我这不是泡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You never make coffee. -  I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.44,0:54:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不想喝吗  -  你不用没完没了地道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you want it? -  You don't have to keep apologising.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.46,0:55:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.63,0:55:09.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不加糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.31,0:55:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些记录可追溯到将近两个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}These records go back nearly two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.61,0:55:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好喝  很香\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.10,0:55:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是在电视播出后  想到这主意的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that when you had the idea, after the TV show went out?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.20,0:55:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我  是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.12,0:55:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  盖瑞  我忍不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Gary. I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.56,0:55:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在卡尔婚礼上吃了个熏肉三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a bacon sandwich at Cal's wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后就一发不可收拾了  -  好借口  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- and one thing led to another. -  Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.23,0:55:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we were just trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.76,0:55:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,添点油  加点醋  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}give things a bit of a boost, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.45,0:55:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒原上有条失控的大狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let a great big dog run wild up on the moor,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是天赐良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was heaven-sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我们有了自己的尼斯湖水怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like us having our own Loch Ness monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.88,0:55:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们把它关在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where do you keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.37,0:55:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边有个老矿井  不太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old mine shaft. It's not too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.00,0:55:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它本来挺好的  -  本来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was all right there. -  Was?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.99,0:55:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们控制不住那畜生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't control the bloody thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.48,0:55:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它实在太凶残\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.40,0:55:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后  一个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.33,0:56:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利带它去了兽医那里  然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy took him to the vet and, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.13,0:56:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.41,0:56:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.77,0:56:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.82,0:56:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.27,0:56:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a joke, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.96,0:56:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hilarious
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.84,0:56:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们差点把一个人逼疯掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've nearly driven a man out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.08,0:56:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实他很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's actually pleased you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.92,0:56:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷偷高兴着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretly pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.14,0:56:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.69,0:56:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计他就是喜欢所有熟人凑在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose he likes having all the same faces back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.07,0:56:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以满足他的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appeals to his... his... 
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.32,0:56:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯伯格综合症(自闭症)吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asperger's?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.32,0:56:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.18,0:56:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信他们杀掉那条狗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you believe them about having the dog destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.25,0:56:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没理由不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.54,0:56:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望没造成什么伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hopefully there's no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.01,0:56:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道该以什么罪名起诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not quite sure what I'd charge them with, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.61,0:57:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去跟本地警方谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a word with the local force.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.38,0:57:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  就这样吧  回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, that's that, then. Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.09,0:57:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.01,0:57:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦的污浊气一扫而空的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to get London out of your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.56,0:57:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们在荒原上看到的就是他们的狗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that was their dog that people saw out on the moor?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.58,0:57:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貌似是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.54,0:57:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是你看到的那条  那不是普通的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that wasn't what you saw, that wasn't just an ordinary dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.82,0:57:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  它体型庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It was immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.92,0:57:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目如赤焰  还在发光  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had burning red eyes, and it was glowing, John,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.31,0:57:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它全身都在发光\N{\fnArial\fs30}its whole body was glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.80,0:57:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个猜想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.64,0:57:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还得回巴斯克维尔验证一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need to get back into Baskerville to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.07,0:57:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么去  上次的把戏不能再用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? Can't pull off the ID trick again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.08,0:57:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没必要再用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might not have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.09,0:57:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  亲爱的哥哥  你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother, dear. How ARE you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.86,0:58:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午好  先生  请关闭引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon, sir. Can you turn the engine off?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.41,0:58:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.47,0:58:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一进去就得去找巴里莫尔少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see Major Barrymore as soon as we get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.68,0:58:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.  
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.13,0:58:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以你来找那条猎犬  -  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means you'll have to start the search for the hound. -  OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.20,0:58:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在实验室找  先找斯坦佩顿那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the labs. Stapleton's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.01,0:58:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.53,0:58:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.62,0:58:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全乐意让你在这里为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to give you unlimited access to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.00,0:58:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.57,0:58:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个请求很简单  少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a simple enough request, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没听过这么荒谬的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard of anything so bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.84,0:58:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要给我24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're to give me 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.14,0:58:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是说定了的  -  一秒也不许多待\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it's what I negotiated. -  Not a second more.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.85,0:58:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得不服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have to comply with this order,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.42,0:58:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不必喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't have to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.93,0:58:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白你究竟想在这儿找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you expect to find here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.40,0:58:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许是真相  -  什么真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perhaps the truth. -  About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.69,0:58:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.00,0:58:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧你这身打扮  我早该看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big coat should have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.06,0:58:59.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是个相信阴谋论的家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the conspiracy lot, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.63,0:59:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好  去吧  发掘真相吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, go ahead, seek them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.23,0:59:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么怪物  致命射线  外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the monsters, the death rays, the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.42,0:59:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这儿有这些东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got any of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.37,0:59:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是好奇而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.52,0:59:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有两个  60年代在这里坠机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple. Crash landed here in the '60s.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.14,0:59:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们叫它们两傻组合(喜剧演员)\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them Abbott and Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.14,0:59:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.48,0:59:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运  福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.57,0:59:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.88,1:01:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. God. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.53,1:01:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.26,1:03:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别  拜托了  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.85,1:03:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naive. 
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.51,1:03:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别胡思乱想  接电话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be ridiculous. Pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.50,1:03:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.66,1:03:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.60,1:04:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在这儿  跟我在一个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. It's in here with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.13,1:05:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.49,1:05:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我出去  夏洛克  你得救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out, Sherlock, you've got to get me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.72,1:05:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在大实验室  我们看的第一个实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big lab, the first lab that we saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.54,1:05:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John... John?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.42,1:05:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就来  夏洛克  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sherlock! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.97,1:05:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我这就来找你  你接着说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll find you. Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.20,1:05:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  它会听到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, it'll hear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着说  你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking. What are you seeing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.98,1:05:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  -  我听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John? -  Yes, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.27,1:05:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.99,1:05:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  但我能听见它的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know, but I can hear it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.19,1:05:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.97,1:05:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静  保持冷静  你能看见它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm, stay calm. Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.23,1:05:52.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看见它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.69,1:05:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.68,1:06:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.62,1:06:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. It's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.69,1:06:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right? John?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.55,1:06:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的老天  就是那条猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! It was the hound!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.21,1:06:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  它就在这儿  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, it was here, I swear it,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.12,1:06:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  它肯定是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, it must, it must...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.88,1:06:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见它了吗  你肯定看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did-did you see it? You must have!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.91,1:06:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, it's OK now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.33,1:06:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  才怪  怎么会没事  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not! It's not ok!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.70,1:06:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见它了  之前是我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it, I was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.27,1:06:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别急着下结论  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, let's not jump to conclusions. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.56,1:06:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.36,1:06:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了  我看到那条猎犬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, i saw the hound.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.90,1:06:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 体型巨大  目如赤焰  -  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huge, red eyes? -  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.22,1:06:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发着光  -  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glowing? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.89,1:06:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.07,1:06:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光那部分是我编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made up the bit about glowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.38,1:06:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听过我的描述  于是以为自己看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what you expected to see because I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.98,1:06:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被下了药  我们都中招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been drugged. We have all been drugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.07,1:06:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugged?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.82,1:06:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还能走吗  -  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you walk? -  Of course I can walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.50,1:06:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  该摆平这妖孽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, then. It's time to lay this ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.44,1:07:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Back again?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.29,1:07:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次又是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on your mind this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.43,1:07:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谋杀  斯坦佩顿医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder, Dr Stapleton.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.07,1:07:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精心策划  冷血无情的谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refined, cold-blooded murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.06,1:07:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你来为小柯丝蒂揭开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell little Kirsty
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.57,1:07:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铃兰的失踪之谜呢  还是我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to Bluebell, or shall I?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.69,1:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你究竟想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.03,1:07:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能借你显微镜一用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow your microscope?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.11,1:07:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you're OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来很憔悴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look very peaky.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.57,1:07:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.41,1:07:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是水母的绿色荧光蛋白基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the GFP gene from a jellyfish,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.20,1:07:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你好奇的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.29,1:07:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.93,1:07:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让兔子发亮的  -  对  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the rabbits. -  Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.48,1:07:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基因取自水晶水母  如果你想知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aequorea victoria, if you really want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.95,1:07:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么这么做  -  为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? -  Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.86,1:08:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这儿不问这种问题  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't ask questions like that here. It isn't done.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.66,1:08:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不小心搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mix-up, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.83,1:08:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿拿走了一只试验样品\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter ended up with one of the lab specimens,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.63,1:08:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的铃兰只能消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so poor Bluebell had to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.04,1:08:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可真够慈悲  -  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your compassion is overwhelming! -  I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.99,1:08:12.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时我也讨厌自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate myself sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.89,1:08:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好  你可以信任我  我也是个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come on, then, you can trust me, I'm a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.20,1:08:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这儿还藏了什么不可告人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else have you got hidden away up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.09,1:08:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  你好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you can imagine it,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.67,1:08:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他地方可能也有人从事这种研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone is probably doing it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.17,1:08:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.52,1:08:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克隆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloning?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.16,1:08:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  克隆羊多利  还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. Dolly the Sheep, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.79,1:08:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克隆人呢  -  有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Human cloning? -  Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.21,1:08:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么克隆动物  除了羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about animals? Not sheep.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.03,1:08:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大型的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.18,1:08:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体型大小不难控制  小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Size isn't a problem. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.63,1:08:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的约束就是伦理与法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only limits are ethics and the law and
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.53,1:08:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这些都可以变通\N{\fnArial\fs30}both those things can be very flexible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.85,1:08:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在这儿不是  在巴斯克威尔不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not here, not at Baskerville.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.62,1:08:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老天  -  什么都没有  说不通呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! -  Nothing there! It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.58,1:08:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为能找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you expecting to find?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.09,1:08:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是某种药物  肯定是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drug, of course. It has to be a drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以引发幻觉或精神错乱之类\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hallucinogenic or a deliriant of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.78,1:09:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖里什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no trace of anything in the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.01,1:09:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 糖  -  糖  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sugar? -  Sugar, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.30,1:09:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简单的排除法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple process of elimination.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.62,1:09:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了猎犬  当然那是我的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the hound, saw it as my imagination expected me to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.35,1:09:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我以为那是个转基因怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genetically engineered monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.53,1:09:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道自己看到的是假象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I couldn't believe the evidence with my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.12,1:09:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以可能有七种解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there were seven possible reasons for it,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.63,1:09:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最有可能的一种就是药物影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most possible being narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.08,1:09:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利·奈特  他也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Knight, he saw it too,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.80,1:09:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你没有  约翰  你没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't, John. You didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.00,1:09:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从来到格林盆  我们吃的喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have eaten and drunk exactly the same things
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.82,1:09:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一模一样  只有一个例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we got to Grimpen, apart from one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.13,1:09:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喝咖啡不加糖  -  懂了  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't take sugar in your coffee. -  I see, so?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.11,1:09:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从亨利的厨房里拿了点糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it from Henry's kitchen, his sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.62,1:09:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它完全没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfectly all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.87,1:09:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许并非药物所致  -  不  肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But maybe it's not a drug. -  No, it has to be a drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.61,1:09:44.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,药物究竟是如何进入我们体内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it get into our systems? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.84,1:09:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有些什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be something, something...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.30,1:09:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.12,1:09:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一些藏得很深的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something buried deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.13,1:09:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出去  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.15,1:10:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去  我要进入我的思维殿堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out, I need to go to my mind palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.29,1:10:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.62,1:10:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一时半会儿不会怎么说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to be doing much talking for a while,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we may as well go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.11,1:10:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的什么  -  他的思维殿堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His what? -  His "Mind Palace".
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.82,1:10:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种记忆方式  一种思维地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a memory technique, a sort of mental map.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.86,1:10:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在地图上绘制地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plot a map with a location,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.53,1:10:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必是真实的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't have to be a real place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把记忆存储在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deposit memories there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.24,1:10:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理论上来说  这样你什么都不会遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, you never forget anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.93,1:10:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要找对途径  就能找回记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you do is find your way back to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.47,1:10:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这种意念化地点可以是任何场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this imaginary location could be anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.49,1:10:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比方一座房子或一条街  -  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a house or a street? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.08,1:10:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他说是"殿堂"  他说那是殿堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he said "Palace", he said it was a palace?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.52,1:10:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  他不就这德性吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, he would, wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.28,1:11:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't nothing...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.72,1:11:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hound.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.67,1:11:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.07,1:12:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  我很抱歉  真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god! Oh my god! I am so... I am so sorry. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.61,1:12:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰  -  我守着门呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John? -  Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.53,1:12:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project HOUND.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.44,1:12:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定在哪看到过  记下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have read about it, stored it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.24,1:12:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中情局在印第安纳州自由城进行的试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experimented in a CIA facility in Liberty, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.71,1:12:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,H-O-U-N-D\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-O-U-N-D.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.30,1:12:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕我的权限不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as far as my access goes, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.29,1:12:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定还有途径  比方说密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be an override, a password?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.98,1:12:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是的  但只有巴里莫尔少校知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine so, but that'd be Major Barrymore's.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.42,1:12:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,密码  密码  密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Password, password. Password.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.27,1:13:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是坐在这里想出的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sat here when he thought it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.09,1:13:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我描述一下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Describe him to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.19,1:13:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你见过他  -  我要你描述他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've seen him. -  But describe him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.44,1:13:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他恪守纪律  厚古薄今\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bloody martinet, a throw-back,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.81,1:13:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能够被委以重任的人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sort they'd have sent into Suez.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.19,1:13:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  老派人物  传统主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, excellent, old-fashioned. Traditionalist.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.60,1:13:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会用孩子的名字当密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the sort to use his children's name as a password.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.90,1:13:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他热爱这份工作  为之骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves his job, proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.87,1:13:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,密码一定与工作相关\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is work-related.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.69,1:13:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么他视线里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's at eye level?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.16,1:13:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.51,1:13:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《简氏防务周刊》  装订版\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane's Defence Weekly, bound copies.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.46,1:13:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《汉尼拔》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannibal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.40,1:13:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威灵顿  隆美尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wellington. Rommel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.40,1:13:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丘吉尔著的《英语国家史》  共四卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Churchill's History of the english-Speaking Peoples, all four volumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.02,1:13:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丘吉尔  他喜欢丘吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Churchill, he's fond of Churchill.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.31,1:13:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《唐宁街岁月》  一共五本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy of The Downing Street Years, one to five.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.22,1:13:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好几本撒切尔的传记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separate biographies of Thatcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.96,1:13:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,19世纪80年代中期  应该是他父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mid-1980s, at a guess. Father and son.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.49,1:13:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老巴里莫尔  很多勋章  金十字英勇勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barrymore Senior, medals, Distinguished Service Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.21,1:13:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个日期  应该是马岛战争的老兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That date, I'd say Falklands veteran.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  这么说撒切尔比丘吉尔更有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Thatcher's a more likely bet than Churchill.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.50,1:13:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是密码吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the password?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.70,1:13:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  巴里莫尔少校这种男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! With a man like Major Barrymore,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.97,1:13:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会用名字来做密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}only first name terms would do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.60,1:14:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hound.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.67,1:14:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.54,1:14:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project HOUND.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.03,1:14:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种新型毒药  能让服药者极易受到暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new deliriant drug which rendered its users incredibly suggestible.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.67,1:14:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想将其用作针对人的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to use it as an anti-personnel weapon,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.26,1:14:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用恐惧和刺激彻底扰乱敌人的心智\N{\fnArial\fs30}to totally disorientate the enemy using fear and stimulus.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.68,1:15:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这个项目在1986年就被关闭和掩盖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they shut it down and hid it away in 1986.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.09,1:15:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那些药物对被试者的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what it did to the subjects they tested it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.40,1:15:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他们对其他人的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what they did to others.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.26,1:15:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长期的药物作用把他们逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prolonged exposure drove them insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.17,1:15:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们变得异常狂暴  无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made them almost uncontrollably aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.24,1:15:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么说有人又在研究了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, someone's been doing it again? 
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.39,1:15:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续这项试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrying on the experiments?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.69,1:15:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是想改进这种药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempting to refine it, perhaps. 
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.12,1:15:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 20多年了  -  是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For the last 20 years. -  Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.14,1:15:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些名字你有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those names mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.41,1:15:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  没印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.81,1:15:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五名主要科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five principal scientists.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.82,1:15:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.61,1:15:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是这张照片后面的某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe our friend's somewhere in the back of the picture?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.31,1:15:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在年纪应该比较大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone old enough to be there
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.20,1:15:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他1986年的时候就在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the time of the experiments in 1986?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.80,1:15:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是个说"手机"的人(英国不这么说)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe somebody who says "Cell phone"
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.77,1:15:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他在美国待过  记得吗  约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of time spent in America? You remember, John? 
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.50,1:15:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my, cell number.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.34,1:15:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给了我们他的号码  让我们有需要就联系他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave us his number, in case we needed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.87,1:15:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  是鲍勃·弗兰克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, Bob Frankland.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.90,1:15:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但鲍勃不研究这个  他是病毒学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Bob doesn't work on... He's a virologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.28,1:15:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是化学武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is chemical warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.69,1:15:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是他起步的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he started, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.42,1:16:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直都坚信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never lost the certainty,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.05,1:16:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚信这种药物肯定能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}the obsession that that drug really could work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.13,1:16:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好他给了我们他的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice of him to give us his number.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.79,1:16:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们和他碰个头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's arrange a little meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.38,1:16:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.89,1:16:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁  -  你们得去找亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's this? -  You've got to find Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.69,1:16:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是露易丝·莫蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Louise Mortimer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.25,1:16:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露易丝  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louise, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.69,1:16:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利刚刚在回想当时的情景  然后他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry was, was remembering. Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.12,1:16:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.15,1:16:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有枪  他拿着枪跑了  他想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a gun, he went for the gun and tried to... 
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.37,1:16:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.22,1:16:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跑了  但你得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone. But you've got to stop him,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.32,1:16:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他会做出什么事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he might do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.62,1:16:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.68,1:16:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在他家  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}His house. I'm OK. I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.16,1:16:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  在那儿别动  我会让人去找你  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, stay there. We'll get someone to you, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.01,1:16:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是亨利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry? 
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.96,1:16:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他袭击了她  -  他跑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's attacked her. -  Gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.43,1:16:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定去了那里  这一切开始的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one place he'll go, back to where it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.87,1:16:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷斯垂德  快去山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade? Get to the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.31,1:17:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔谷  快  带上枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewer's Hollow, now! And bring a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.47,1:17:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.66,1:17:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.89,1:17:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  亨利  别这样  -  别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Henry, no, no! -  Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.54,1:18:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 离我远点  -  别紧张  亨利  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from me! -  Easy, Henry, easy. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我的毛病  我知道我差点做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am, I know what I tried to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.56,1:18:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪放下  没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put the gun down, it's OK.  
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.09,1:18:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我知道我的毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! I know what I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.09,1:18:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  你当然知道  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure you do, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.46,1:18:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有人这么跟你说的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all been explained to you, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.03,1:18:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很清楚地解释了  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Explained very carefully. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.53,1:18:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人要让你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone needed to keep you quiet,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.40,1:18:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你走不出童年的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}needed to keep you as a child,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.55,1:18:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你再次坚信你的梦魇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reassert the dream you both clung on to,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.58,1:18:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你开始想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you had started to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.39,1:18:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想起来  亨利  你必须想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember now, Henry, you've got to remember
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.96,1:18:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小时候这里究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened here when you were a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.44,1:18:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得它抓住了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it had got my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.58,1:18:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那条猎犬  我以为...天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hound. I thought... Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.49,1:18:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不...我什么都不知道了  不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't... I don't know any more! I don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.92,1:18:42.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  亨利  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Henry! Henry, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.98,1:18:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利  再想想  "自由""在"这两个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, remember. "Liberty In." Two words.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.68,1:18:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20年前一个吓坏了的孩子看到的两个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words a frightened little boy saw here 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.77,1:18:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开始拼凑起了事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd started to piece things together.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.07,1:18:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记起了当晚真正发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what happened here that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.70,1:18:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实不是动物吧  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't an animal, was it, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.57,1:18:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.29,1:18:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.69,1:19:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还只是个孩子  你接受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't cope. You were just a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.29,1:19:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你把它解释成很奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you rationalised it into something very different.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.39,1:19:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你开始想起来了  有人要阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you started to remember, so you had to be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.45,1:19:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你逼疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driven out of your mind
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.40,1:19:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就没人会相信你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that no-one would believe a word that you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.48,1:19:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.00,1:19:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.80,1:20:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.76,1:20:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们看到了猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we saw it, the hound, 
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.03,1:20:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚我们都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}last night. We did, we s...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.14,1:20:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是有条狗  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but there was a dog, Henry,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.12,1:20:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留下脚印  惊吓路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving footprints, scaring witnesses,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.88,1:20:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那不过是条普通的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing more than an ordinary dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.79,1:20:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们中毒了  所以把它想成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both saw it, saw it as our drugged minds wanted us to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.63,1:20:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧和刺激  就是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear and stimulus, that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.61,1:20:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实根本就没有什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there never was any monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.64,1:20:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.78,1:20:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  不要  -  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No, no, no, no! -  Henry, 
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.94,1:20:33.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亨利  -  夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry... -  Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.14,1:20:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No, no, no, noooo!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.87,1:20:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.24,1:20:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克  你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.22,1:20:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  他没被下药  夏洛克  那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, he is not drugged, Sherlock, so what's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.28,1:20:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  -  到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! -  What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.98,1:20:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  它还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.57,1:20:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只是条狗  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just a dog, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.94,1:20:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一条普通的狗罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing more than an ordinary dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.20,1:20:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.70,1:20:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.93,1:21:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.73,1:21:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你  不可能是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not you, not you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.06,1:21:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是烟雾  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The fog. -  What? 
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.31,1:21:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里的雾  雾里有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the fog, the drug, it's in the fog!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.73,1:21:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气态传播  记录里就是这么写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerosol dispersant, that's what it said in the records.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.92,1:21:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎犬计划  是雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project HOUND, it's the fog!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.84,1:21:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化学雷区\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chemical minefield.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.96,1:21:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷  快杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, kill it! Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.00,1:22:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.76,1:22:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  -  快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. -  Come on, look at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.97,1:22:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.14,1:22:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.23,1:22:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20年了  我白白痛苦了20年\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 years! 20 years of my life, making no sense! 
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.12,1:22:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不直接杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.88,1:22:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为死人反而会引起疑心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because dead men get listened to,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.55,1:22:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能只杀掉你那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}he needed to do more than kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.03,1:22:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要让你说的关于你父亲的一切都站不住脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to discredit every word you ever said about your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.23,1:22:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他的武器就在他脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he had the means right at his feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.59,1:22:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化学雷区  地底下的压力垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chemical minefield, pressure pads in the ground,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.24,1:22:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每次回到这里  都会对你下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}dosing you up every time that you came back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.19,1:22:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既是凶器也是犯案现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder weapon and scene of the crime all at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.52,1:22:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个案子真是  太谢谢你了  亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case, Henry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.93,1:22:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been brilliant! 
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.94,1:22:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克  -  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.12,1:22:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.78,1:22:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不合适吗  -  不  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not good? -  No, no, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.80,1:22:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  因为这意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. Because this means...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.61,1:23:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这意味着我父亲说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}this means that my dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.13,1:23:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他确实发现了秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd found something out, hadn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.93,1:23:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你杀了他  因为他说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why you killed him, because he was right,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.26,1:23:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发现了你不可告人的试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd found you right in the middle of an experiment!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.11,1:23:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankland!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.66,1:23:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 弗兰克兰  -  接着跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frankland! -  Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.02,1:23:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep up!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.35,1:23:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的  弗兰克兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no use, Frankland.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.36,1:24:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.18,1:24:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这么说他们没杀死那条狗  -  显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So they didn't have it put down then, the dog? -  Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.24,1:24:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计他们就是下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose they just couldn't bring themselves to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.79,1:24:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.35,1:24:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.49,1:24:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  我不懂  是因为有感情吗  -  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. Sentiment? -  Sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.84,1:25:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  我在实验室里是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, what happened to me in the lab?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.79,1:25:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要加点沙司吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want some sauce with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.69,1:25:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没去过山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't been to the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.61,1:25:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会听到那种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I heard those things there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.17,1:25:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的恐惧和刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear and stimulus, you said?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.61,1:25:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定在别处被下药了  也许在实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have been dosed with it elsewhere. In the lab, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.14,1:25:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到那些管子了  年代久远  可能泄露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw those pipes, pretty ancient, leaky as a sieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.25,1:25:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那里面是有气体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were carrying the gas,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.07,1:25:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那  来点番茄酱吗  -  慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so... Ketchup was it, or brown? -  Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.75,1:25:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为是在糖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought it was in the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.17,1:25:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时确定是在糖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were convinced it was in the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.39,1:25:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得出发了  火车还有一个半小时就开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better get going, there's a train leaving in half an hour, 
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.58,1:25:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果你想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you want...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.06,1:25:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天  是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! It was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.17,1:25:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我关在那该死的实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You locked me in that bloody lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.95,1:25:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不得不那么做  那是个试验  -  试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had to, it was an experiment. -  An experiment?! 
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.58,1:25:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吓坏了  夏洛克  快吓死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was terrified, Sherlock, I was scared to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.10,1:25:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为毒药在糖里  所以在你咖啡里放了糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the drug was in the sugar, so I put some in your coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.93,1:25:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着我找巴里莫尔少校安排了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I arranged everything with Major Barrymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.28,1:25:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全科学的实验控制环境  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally scientific, laboratory conditions, literally.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.12,1:25:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你接着说话  我这就来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep talking, I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.43,1:25:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.31,1:25:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  它会听到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, it'll hear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.55,1:26:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you're seeing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.35,1:26:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  但我能听见它的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I can hear it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.28,1:26:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道毒药对天才大脑的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew what effect it had had on a superior mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.03,1:26:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我得在常人的大脑上试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I needed to try it on an average one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.02,1:26:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.84,1:26:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但药不在糖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't in the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.49,1:26:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你已经接触过气体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, well, i wasn't to know you'd already been exposed to the gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.56,1:26:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以你搞错了  -  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you got it wrong. -  No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.91,1:26:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是错了  不在糖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong. It wasn't in the sugar, 
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.79,1:26:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你弄错了  -  错了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you got it wrong. -  A bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.47,1:26:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.97,1:26:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有长期副作用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any long-term effects?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.95,1:26:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会  你排泄掉就没事了  我们都会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}None at all. You'll be fine once you've excreted it. We all will.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.99,1:26:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我想我已经搞定这个问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have taken care of that already.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.23,1:26:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你去哪  -  马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? -  I won't be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.06,1:26:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找个男人聊聊一条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to see a man about a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.64,1:27:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let him go.
